<li><strong>Preschool:</strong> math and early literacy with natural voice narration, for children aged 4 to 6.</li>
<li><strong>Games and labs:</strong> arcade games, interactive simulators and mini-game templates; more than 200 games in total.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Blocks and real code, depending on age</h3>
<p>It includes a block editor (Blockly) and a code editor (Monaco), with three age bands: icons, mixed and code. A first grader drags blocks with pictures; a fifth grader is already writing instructions such as <em>heroe.avanzar()</em> (“hero, move forward”) or <em>repetir(3)</em> (“repeat 3 times”).</p>
<h3>Natural voice for children who can’t read yet</h3>
<p>In Preschool, every instruction is narrated in a natural voice and supported by large icons, so children learn even before they can read or write.</p>
