<li><strong>Set up groups and campuses</strong> in the teacher dashboard.</li>
<li><strong>Map the worlds to your curriculum plan:</strong> decide which subjects will accompany each math, science or technology unit.</li>
<li><strong>Start with an unplugged activity</strong> and a short first session on the platform.</li>
<li><strong>Review the statistics every week</strong> and adjust assignments based on what you see.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Best practices and precautions</h2>
<ul>
