<h2>What is CodeNest School?</h2>
<p>CodeNest School is a coding platform for kids developed by Grupo Logic and made in Colombia. It brings together 30 worlds, 600 activities and three age groups, with every instruction narrated by a human voice in Spanish.</p>
<p>It runs in the browser, with no downloads and no ads. It’s designed for tablets, with large buttons and touch-based play, although it also works on computers. Children don’t need an email address: they log in with a player name and a PIN made of four pictures.</p>
